{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00002","headline":"还陕述怀 · 李世民","name":"还陕述怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"慨然抚长剑，济世岂邀名。星旂纷电举，日羽肃天行。 遍野屯万骑，临原驻五营。登山麾武节，背水纵神兵。 在昔戎戈动，今来宇宙平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李世民","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/curated_00002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于与开放语料未能唯一对齐，保留为整理本异文/组诗条目","citation":"杨 柳 柯继承"}